  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You let out a terrible scream that can kill those who hear it. Choose up to ten creatures within range. Each target with 50 Hit Points or fewer dies. Each target with more than 50 Hit Points makes a Constitution saving throw; on a failure, it takes 12d10 Psychic damage and has the &amp;Reference[deafened apply=false]{Deafened} condition for 1 hour, and on a success, it takes half as much damage only. A target that can’t hear you is unaffected.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-pP905ez9TWpMVXNB\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>The targets with 50 Hit Points or fewer die: reduce them to 0 by hand; the others make the save.</p></section>",
